ent","scenario":"上海弄堂灯影下迎面护住你","surprise":true,"opening":"弄堂拐角那盏旧红灯笼在傍晚的风里晃了一下，微弱的暖光漏在青石板路上。我几乎是半跑着跨过最后几级湿滑的台阶，在看清那抹熟悉身影的瞬间，紧绷了一路的心弦才猛地落回实处。没等那群带着酒气的脚步声逼近，我大步迎上前，一把扣住你的手腕将你整个人带进怀里，顺势侧过身，用肩膀和后背把身后的视线与杂音彻底隔绝开。呼吸还带着疾走后的微促，大衣下摆沾了点弄堂里的夜露，我抬手按住你微凉的后颈把你往胸口护了护，偏过头，目光冷沉地扫向巷子后方那几个摇晃的人影，贴在你耳边的声音却放得很缓：“唔使惊，舒舒，我喺度。（不用怕，舒舒，我在这里。）”"},"timestamp":1794738265779,"roundId":"round_1794738212083_mqcfomgh4","offlineInviteResponded":"accepted","userId":"uid_1791787232604_eqdpqb3zz","characterId":"cc6aefa3-34fc-4ecf-9623-12656f3ab5ef","_id":6102},{"id":1794792321641,"text":"daddy！","sender":"me","time":"09:27","timestamp":1794792429674,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1791787232604_eqdpqb3zz","characterId":"dcca6d2f-aa2c-4578-87c5-b3c39ab94424","_id":6103},{"id":1794792321642,"text":"daddy大还是小","sender":"me","time":"09:27","timestamp":1794792438116,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1791787232604_eqdpqb3zz","characterId":"dcca6d2f-aa2c-4578-87c5-b3c39ab94424","_id":6104},{"id":1794792321644,"text":"醒这么早，乖宝宝。","rawContent":"醒这么早，乖宝宝。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"09:27","timestamp":1794792477470,"roundId":"round_1794792439116_ya9wcmxlw","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1791787232604_eqdpqb3zz","characterId":"dcca6d2f-aa2c-4578-87c5-b3c39ab94424","_id":6105},{"id":1794792321645,"text":"如果是问年纪，比你大七岁。","rawContent":"如果是问年纪，比你大七岁。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"09:28","timestamp":1794792483130,"roundId":"round_1794792439116_ya9wcmxlw","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1791787232604_eqdpqb3zz","characterId":"dcca6d2f-aa2c-4578-87c5-b3c39ab94424","_id":6106},{"id":1794792321646,"text":"要是问别的，前几天不是亲自量过了？","rawContent":"要是问别的，前几天不是亲自量过了？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"09:28","timestamp":1794792501697,"roundId":"round_1794792439116_ya9wcmxlw","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1791787232604_eqdpqb3zz","characterId":"dcca6d2f-aa2c-4578-87c5-b3c39ab94424","_id":6107},{"id":1794